{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CejjdN6DrU5XSFyjm4xUf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WFembQA2WciA4eqnz1dMZs","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/diytechy/.claude/projects/-Users-diytechy-Documents-ai-template/memory/refresh-bar-runs-no-tests-below-impl.md","content":"---\nname: refresh-bar-runs-no-tests-below-impl\ndescription: The lane refresh's Bar-Green attests check.py at the repo's rung — at DevStg-Tests that is 14 steps and zero test steps, so \"the refresh runs the full suite for you\" is false here\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\n`integrate._run_bar` runs `check.py --jobs 0 --tier all`, and check.py's step\ntable declares the product `format` / `lint` / `tests+coverage` steps relevant\nfrom `_kitladder.STAGE_IMPL`. This repo's `docs/stage` reads **DevStg-Tests**,\none rung below — so the merge-slot refresh's `Bar-Green:` trailer attests a bar\nof 14 steps that runs **no tests at all** (measured 2026-09-05, WI-580 REVIEW-A\nround 008). Between the smoke commit bar and phase close, nothing runs the\nsuite.\n\n**Why:** any brief, skill or CLAUDE.md sentence saying the lane refresh \"runs\nthe full declared bar\" is only true from DevStg-Impl up. Below it the sentence\nexcuses a worker from the only suite that would have run. WI-580 fixed the\nworker brief to name the rung and point at check.py's step table rather than\nrestate it; ungating the step is a ladder-semantics change every adopter would\nmigrate to, so it is an owner's call, not a lane's.\n\n**How to apply:** before writing or trusting \"the bar covers X\", read\n`docs/stage` and check.py's step table, or just run `check.py --jobs 0` and\nread the summary — it prints every step it selected. Don't infer coverage from\n`--tier all`. See [[rederive-dont-rerun-measured-claims]] and\n[[stale-not-discharged-clauses-on-approved-rows]].\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":183,"cache_read_input_tokens":129822,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":183},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"13327e09-90e1-45dd-941b-0d4bfb0cab91","uuid":"55533fb9-9a2b-4386-8f60-0215226fedcd","request_id":"req_011CejjdMS2bm5RZMDuwkSuf"}
